{"title":"Career Roadmap · Cyber Law Consultant","role":"Cyber Law Consultant","summary":"A Cyber Law Consultant advises organizations, technology companies, startups, financial institutions and individuals on legal issues arising from digital technologies, cybersecurity, electronic transactions, online platforms and data processing.","facts":{"Current degree":"Law - LLB / BA LLB / BBA LLB / B.Com LLB / B.Sc LLB (Integrated)","Course":"Cyber Law"},"about":[],"intro":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Decision"},{"text":"Legal principle"}]}],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Cyber Law Consultant advises organizations, technology companies, startups, financial institutions and individuals on legal issues arising from digital technologies, cybersecurity, electronic transactions, online platforms and data processing."},{"type":"p","text":"The role sits at the intersection of:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Law","Technology","Cybersecurity","Privacy","Compliance","Risk Management"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Typical work may involve:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data protection and privacy"},{"text":"Cybersecurity compliance"},{"text":"Cybercrime-related legal matters"},{"text":"Incident-response legal support"},{"text":"Electronic contracts"},{"text":"Technology agreements"},{"text":"Digital evidence"},{"text":"Online fraud"},{"text":"Intellectual property in digital environments"},{"text":"Platform and intermediary issues"},{"text":"Regulatory compliance"},{"text":"Cyber-risk advisory"},{"text":"Technology policy"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A Cyber Law Consultant is not necessarily a cybersecurity engineer or ethical hacker. However, understanding how cyber incidents technically occur is extremely valuable for translating technical risk into legal and regulatory consequences."},{"type":"note","label":"Important scope note","text":"The title “Cyber Law Consultant” is not a single universally regulated 