 fraud"},{"text":"Cybersecurity regulation"},{"text":"Digital evidence"},{"text":"Privacy"},{"text":"Data protection"},{"text":"Intermediary/platform regulation"},{"text":"Intellectual property in digital environments"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Cyber Incident Example"},{"type":"flow","items":["Cyber Incident","Technical Investigation","Evidence Preservation","Legal Assessment","Regulatory / Contractual Obligations","Notification / Response","Remediation","Post-Incident Review"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Privacy, Cybersecurity & Technology Transactions"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop deeper knowledge of:"},{"type":"h","text":"Privacy"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Personal data"},{"text":"Sensitive information concepts"},{"text":"Consent"},{"text":"Purpose limitation"},{"text":"Data minimization"},{"text":"Retention"},{"text":"Data subject rights"},{"text":"Cross-border data issues"},{"text":"Privacy notices"},{"text":"Data processing agreements"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Cybersecurity"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Security controls"},{"text":"Access management"},{"text":"Incident response"},{"text":"Vulnerability management"},{"text":"Security governance"},{"text":"Risk assessment"},{"text":"Third-party risk"},{"text":"Business continuity"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology Contracts"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SaaS agreements"},{"text":"Software licensing"},{"text":"Cloud agreements"},{"text":"Data-processing agreements"},{"text":"IT service agreements"},{"text":"Vendor contracts"},{"text":"Technology outsourcing agreements"}]}]},{"heading":"Final Year — Professional Cyber-Law Practice","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Focus on applying law to realistic technology scenarios."},{"type":"h","text":"Key Areas"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cyber incident response"},{"text":"Privacy compliance"},{"text":"Technology contracts"},{"text":"Digital evidence"},{"text":"Cybercrime"},{"te