"},{"text":"+"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["Technology Fundamentals","Cyber Law Consultant Candidate"]}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"LLB"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Cyber Law"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"IT Law"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Privacy & Data Protection"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Cybersecurity Fundamentals"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Cybercrime"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Digital Evidence"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Technology Contracts"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Legal Research"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Regulatory Compliance"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Cyber Risk Assessment"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Incident Response Concepts"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"AI Governance"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Legal Writing"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Negotiation"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Technology Literacy"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Legal Technology"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"AI-Assisted Legal Research"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"flow","items":["LLB","Cyber/Technology Law Specialization","Cybersecurity/Privacy Internship","Technology Contracts + Privacy + Cyber Compliance","Junior Cyber/Privacy Legal Role","Cyber Law Consultant","Senior Consultant","Cyber/Privacy Legal Manager","Technology Law Partner / Legal Director"]},{"type":"p","text":"For the Cyber Law Consultant pathway, the strongest differentiator is the ability to translate technical cybersecurity and data issues into clear legal obligations, business risks and practical compliance measures. A candidate who combines an LLB with privacy, cybersecurity fundamentals, technology contracts, digital evidence, cybercrime, legal research and emerging AI-governance knowledge will be well positioned for the rapidly expanding intersection of law and technology."}]}]}